  "name": "Nintendo Power",
  "category": "publication_promotion",
  "description": {
    "text": "Nintendo's own magazine, Nintendo Power, came with English promo cards from 1999 to 2003: a Base Set Pikachu with a gold \"E3\" stamp in September 1999, the Black Star promos Mewtwo in April 2000, Dark Persian, mounted on a paper insert, in August 2000, Sabrina's Abra in October 2000, and Rapidash and Ho-oh together in November 2002, and in 2003 non-holo copies of Kyogre ex and Groudon ex, the first Nintendo Black Star Promos, whose holofoil prints went to players at that summer's events. Sabrina's Abra, Rapidash, Ho-oh, Kyogre ex and Groudon ex had first come in Japan with CoroCoro Comic.",
